<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Evolution — a operação de marketing com IA que roda sozinha</title>
<meta name="description" content="Evolução, sem a pressa. Infraestrutura open source de IA e automação para agências e pequenas e médias empresas.">
<meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#07090d">

<style>
  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Design tokens
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  :root {
    --bg:            #07090d;
    --bg-soft:       #0b0f16;
    --surface:       rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
    --surface-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    --border:        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    --border-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);

    --text:          #e9eef6;
    --text-soft:     #b3c0d1;
    --muted:         #8b9aae;

    --accent:        #22d3a6;
    --accent-soft:   rgba(34, 211, 166, 0.14);
    --accent-2:      #4f9cff;

    --radius-sm: 10px;
    --radius:    16px;
    --radius-lg: 24px;

    --max-width: 1140px;
    --gutter: clamp(1.15rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);

    --font: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
            "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", sans-serif;

    --ease: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Reset
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-padding-top: 88px;
    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  p { margin: 0; }

  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

  img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

  ul { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }

  button { font: inherit; color: inherit; }

  :focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Layout helpers
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--gutter);
  }

  .section {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7.5rem);
    position: relative;
  }

  .section--tight { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .section-head {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.75rem);
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.65rem);
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
  }

  .section-head p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.075rem);
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Buttons
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--ease), background 0.2s var(--ease),
                border-color 0.2s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.2s var(--ease);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }

  .btn--primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #04231b;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -12px rgba(34, 211, 166, 0.75);
  }

  .btn--primary:hover {
    background: #2ee5b6;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 38px -14px rgba(34, 211, 166, 0.9);
  }

  .btn--ghost {
    background: transparent;
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .btn--ghost:hover {
    background: var(--surface-hover);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Header
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .site-header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 60;
    background: rgba(7, 9, 13, 0.72);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.3s var(--ease), background 0.3s var(--ease);
  }

  .site-header.is-scrolled {
    border-bottom-color: var(--border);
    background: rgba(7, 9, 13, 0.9);
  }

  .header-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    height: 72px;
  }

  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .brand-mark {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: #04231b;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2rem; }

  .nav-list {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .nav-list a {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    transition: color 0.2s var(--ease);
    position: relative;
  }

  .nav-list a::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: -6px;
    width: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
    transition: width 0.25s var(--ease);
  }

  .nav-list a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .nav-list a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

  .nav-toggle {
    display: none;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .nav-toggle span {
    display: block;
    width: 18px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--text);
    border-radius: 2px;
    position: relative;
    transition: background 0.2s var(--ease);
  }

  .nav-toggle span::before,
  .nav-toggle span::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    width: 18px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--text);
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease), top 0.25s var(--ease);
  }

  .nav-toggle span::before { top: -6px; }
  .nav-toggle span::after  { top: 6px; }

  .nav-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span { background: transparent; }
  .nav-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span::before { top: 0; transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .nav-toggle[aria-expanded="true"] span::after  { top: 0; transform: rotate(-45deg); }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Hero
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 8rem) clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -20% -10% auto -10%;
    height: 720px;
    z-index: -1;
    background:
      radial-gradient(46% 52% at 22% 28%, rgba(34, 211, 166, 0.16), transparent 68%),
      radial-gradient(42% 48% at 78% 12%, rgba(79, 156, 255, 0.16), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 5.4vw, 3.9rem);
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .hero h1 .accent {
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.9vw, 1.16rem);
    color: var(--text-soft);
    max-width: 34rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  .hero-note {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-note svg { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--accent); }

  /* Painel decorativo do hero */
  .hero-panel {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015));
    box-shadow: 0 40px 90px -50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .panel-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }

  .dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2b3444; }
  .dot--live { background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34, 211, 166, 0.16); }

  .panel-bar-title {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .panel-body { padding: 1.35rem 1.1rem 1.6rem; }

  .flow {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .flow-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 0.95rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
  }

  .flow-step .idx {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .flow-step .label {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  .flow-step .status {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .flow-step .status::before {
    content: "";
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    animation: pulse 2.4s var(--ease) infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50%      { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(0.8); }
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Faixa de métricas
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .stat {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    padding: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem) clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
  }

  .stat-value {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .stat-value span { color: var(--accent); }

  .stat-label {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.855rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Cards de recursos
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(276px, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
  }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
    transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease), border-color 0.3s var(--ease),
                background 0.3s var(--ease);
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    background: var(--surface-hover);
  }

  .card-icon {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 1.075rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Como funciona
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
    counter-reset: step;
  }

  .step {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 1.9rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .step::before {
    counter-increment: step;
    content: "0" counter(step);
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.85rem;
    left: 0;
    padding-right: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .step h3 {
    font-size: 1.075rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .step p {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Bloco CTA
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .cta {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(70% 130% at 12% 0%, rgba(34, 211, 166, 0.14), transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(70% 130% at 88% 100%, rgba(79, 156, 255, 0.14), transparent 62%),
      var(--bg-soft);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .cta p {
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    max-width: 46ch;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Footer
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .footer-note {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  .footer-links a { transition: color 0.2s var(--ease); }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Animações de entrada
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(18px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s var(--ease), transform 0.7s var(--ease);
  }

  .reveal.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Responsivo
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .hero-panel { order: 2; }

    .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .nav-toggle { display: grid; }

    .nav {
      position: absolute;
      top: 72px;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 0;
      padding: 0.75rem var(--gutter) 1.35rem;
      background: rgba(9, 12, 18, 0.98);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: none;
    }

    .nav.is-open { display: flex; }

    .nav-list {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .nav-list a {
      display: block;
      padding: 0.85rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .nav-list a::after { display: none; }

    .nav .btn {
      margin-top: 1.1rem;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

    .hero-actions .btn,
    .cta-actions .btn { width: 100%; }
  }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
     Acessibilidade — movimento reduzido
  --------------------------------------------------------- */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }

    *, *::before, *::after {
      animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
      animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
      transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
    }

    .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- ================= HEADER ================= -->
<header class="site-header" id="site-header">
  <div class="container header-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Evolution — página inicial">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">E</span>
      <span>Dark Evolution</span>
    </a>

    <button
      class="nav-toggle"
      id="nav-toggle"
      type="button"
      aria-expanded="false"
      aria-controls="primary-nav"
      aria-label="Abrir menu de navegação">
      <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </button>

    <nav class="nav" id="primary-nav" aria-label="Navegação principal">
      <ul class="nav-list">
        <li><a href="#recursos">Recursos</a></li>
        <li><a href="#como-funciona">Como funciona</a></li>
        <li><a href="#resultados">Resultados</a></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#contato">Falar com especialista</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">

  <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Infraestrutura open source de IA</span>

        <h1>
          A operação de marketing com IA que
          <span class="accent">roda sozinha</span>.
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-lead">
          Evolução, sem a pressa. Implantamos uma infraestrutura open source de
          IA e automação que cuida da operação de marketing de ponta a ponta —
          feita para agências e pequenas e médias empresas.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#contato">
            Falar com especialista
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                 stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"
                 stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#como-funciona">Ver como funciona</a>
        </div>

        <p class="hero-note">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
               stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"
               stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
          </svg>
          Sem dependência de plataformas fechadas. Sem contrato de fidelidade.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-panel" aria-label="Exemplo de fluxo automatizado">
        <div class="panel-bar">
          <span class="dot dot--live" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="panel-bar-title">Pipeline em execução</span>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-body">
          <div class="flow">
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="idx" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
              <span class="label">Coleta e unificação de dados</span>
              <span class="status">Ativo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="idx" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
              <span class="label">Segmentação e enriquecimento por IA</span>
              <span class="status">Ativo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="idx" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
              <span class="label">Geração de criativos e copy</span>
              <span class="status">Ativo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="idx" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
              <span class="label">Distribuição multicanal</span>
              <span class="status">Ativo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-step">
              <span class="idx" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
              <span class="label">Otimização contínua por resultados</span>
              <span class="status">Ativo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
